{"id":"d_main_39_02","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch39","label":"Chapter 39 · Gene"},"label":"Conditions for Conversation","stage":"39-8 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_39_01","next":"d_main_39_03","speakers":{"leviathan":"Leviathan","raptilion":"Raptilion","ziz":"Ziz"},"icons":{"leviathan":"si_c562_00_s","ziz":"si_c561_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_39_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_1","text":"So, let me get this straight... You're human, but you like Raptures so much that you kept trying to communicate with them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_whosdumber","movie":null,"shown":["leviathan","ziz","raptilion"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_2","text":"And you actually succeeded, so now, Mother Whale—","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_3","text":"Whaley.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_4","text":"... So now you're buddies with Whaley and are traveling all over the world together?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_5","text":"That's right. You really are good at summarizing, my friend.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_6","text":"And you're chummy with all the Raptures riding on Whaley too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_7","text":"That's right! They're gentle companions who don't attack just anyone!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_8","text":"You expect me to actually believe that?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_9","text":"Hehe, I don't blame you for doubting me!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_10","text":"But right now, you're inside Whaley's belly, aren't you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_11","text":"A normal Mother Whale wouldn't just let foreign objects wander about inside like that!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_12","text":"It would do everything it can to get rid of them, including unleashing all the Raptures it's carrying inside!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_13","text":"Yeah, I know that too. But how did you find out about that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_14","text":"Haha! Since becoming friends with Whaley, I've tried to befriend other Mother Whales, so I know a thing or two about them!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_15","text":"Though I wasn't successful with any of them, sadly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_16","text":"How are you still alive?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_17","text":"Walking the untread path always carries an element of risk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_18","text":"Anyway, you said you were Heretics, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_19","text":"Yeah. What of it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_20","text":"And you understand me when I speak?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_21","text":"We're talking right now, aren't we?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_22","text":"Can you tell me what you guys call this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_23","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_23","text":"Raptilion rummages around underneath the Rapture suit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_24","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_24","text":"For a moment, Ziz flinches, then Raptilion pulls out a ripe apple.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_25","text":"I found this on the surface recently, and thought it was very beautiful.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_26","text":"What do you guys call this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_27","text":"It's an apple, duh! Do we look like idiots to you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_28","text":"How do you use it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_29","text":"You... uh... eat it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_30","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_31","text":"I see, you perceive things the same way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_32","text":"Tell me, when you come across humans or Nikkes, do you feel an urge to kill them?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_33","text":"No.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_34","text":"Then what do you feel when you see them?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_35","text":"Nothing in particular.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_36","text":"I see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_37","text":"So that means you can become friends with them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_38","text":"Excuse me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_39","text":"There's a communication barrier between humans and Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_40","text":"But in your case, there isn't. You can communicate with humans and other Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_41","text":"And there's no deep-seated hostility inside you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_42","text":"So, since there are no major obstacles to communication,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_43","text":"you can be friends with them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_44","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_45","text":"As long as we can communicate, we can be friends.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_46","text":"Won't you be my friends?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_47","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_48","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_49","text":"Oh dear. Looks like I got a bit excited and came on a little too strong.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_50","text":"Don't worry, take your time to think it over. After all, we're all rational, thoughtful creatures here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_51","text":"Now then, to celebrate this joyful occasion, let me give you a tour of Whaley!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_52","text":"Follow me, there's all sorts of fun stuff I want to show you!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"raptilion","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_53","text":"Oh, and here's an apple for you. It's a gift.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_54","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_54","text":"Still in a daze, Leviathan accepts the apple Raptilion offers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_55","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_55","text":"Raptilion turns on his heel and starts walking.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_56","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_57","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_58","text":"What in the world... My brain's totally fried right now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_59","text":"No, not you too, Levi! I think my mind's on the fritz as well...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_60","text":"What should we do? Should we follow him?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_61","text":"... Yeah, let's follow him first.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_02_62","text":"I have to find out what the hell he's scheming.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}